      "text": "{\"active_time\": {\"evidence\": \"È una specie diurna, con due fasi principali di attività durante la giornata, una la mattina ed una il pomeriggio.\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.monaconatureencyclopedia.com/testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": [\"diurnal\"]}, \"body_length_m\": {\"evidence\": \"presenta dimorfismo sessuale nelle dimensioni corporee, con maschi più piccoli delle femmine (15-25 cm per i maschi e 20-36 cm per le femmine)\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.monaconatureencyclopedia.com/testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": {\"max\": 0.36, \"min\": 0.15}}, \"body_mass_kg\": {\"evidence\": \"Weight: 200g to 3 kg depending on subspecies.\", \"source_url\": \"https://Saskatoon.ca/parks-recreation-attractions/events-attractions/saskatoon-forestry-farm-park-zoo/zoo-animals/greek-tortoise\", \"value\": {\"max\": 3.0, \"min\": 0.2}}, \"body_plan\": {\"evidence\": \"Tortoises locomote with diagonally opposite feet moving together so that two feet are in contact with the ground at almost all times\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-021-04273-w\", \"value\": [\"quadruped\"]}, \"breathing\": {\"evidence\": \"Dorsally, the lungs are broadly fused to the inner side of the carapace\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-021-04273-w\", \"value\": \"lungs\"}, \"breathing_detail\": \"Breathes with paired multicameral faveolar lungs ventilated by a flank-muscle pump (M. obliquus and M. transversus abdominis) moving the limb flanks, not by rib-cage expansion, because ribs are fused to the rigid carapace.\", \"claimed_crosses\": [\"Testudo hermanni\"], \"climate\": {\"evidence\": \"Native to North Africa, Southern Europe, and parts of the Middle East, it thrives in arid and semi-arid habitats.\", \"source_url\": \"https://karachizoo.gov.pk/animals/the-spur-thighed-tortoise-testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": [\"temperate\", \"arid\"]}, \"covering\": {\"evidence\": \"identifiable by its high-domed shell, which provides excellent protection against predators.\", \"source_url\": \"https://karachizoo.gov.pk/animals/the-spur-thighed-tortoise-testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": \"shell\"}, \"diet\": {\"evidence\": \"They have a herbivorous diet, primarily feeding on grasses, leafy greens, flowers, and occasionally fruits.\", \"source_url\": \"https://karachizoo.gov.pk/animals/the-spur-thighed-tortoise-testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": \"herbivore\"}, \"habitat\": {\"evidence\": \"vive principalmente in zone aperte, particolarmente calde e secche, ma anche in boschi termofili, che offrono un'alternanza di zone soleggiate e ombreggianti.\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.monaconatureencyclopedia.com/testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": [\"grassland\", \"forest\", \"desert\"]}, \"mouthparts\": {\"evidence\": \"They graze on low-lying vegetation, using their strong beaks to crop and tear grass blades.\", \"source_url\": \"https://karachizoo.gov.pk/animals/the-spur-thighed-tortoise-testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": \"beak\"}, \"mouthparts_detail\": \"Toothless keratinous beak (rhamphotheca) forming a V-shaped jaw with serrated edge and median tomium for cropping and tearing vegetation; no teeth.\", \"movement\": {\"evidence\": \"The use of only one gait (walking) over their entire limited speed range during locomotion\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-021-04273-w\", \"value\": [\"walk\"]}, \"primary_locomotor_part\": {\"evidence\": \"Tortoises locomote with diagonally opposite feet moving together so that two feet are in contact with the ground at almost all times\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-021-04273-w\", \"value\": \"four legs\"}, \"visible_features\": {\"evidence\": \"Their domed carapace (upper shell) is usually brown or yellowish-brown in color, with prominent growth rings and scutes. They have distinctive spurs on their thighs. Their legs are sturdy and adapted for terrestrial locomotion, ending in strong claws\", \"source_url\": \"https://karachizoo.gov.pk/animals/the-spur-thighed-tortoise-testudo-graeca/\", \"value\": [\"high-domed brown-yellow carapace\", \"distinct thigh spurs\", \"sturdy scaly legs\", \"strong claws\"]}}",
